  "methods": [
   "DllFacts.colorless_card_pool"
  ],
  "note": "Read from the assembly's own IL. `card_pool_census.json` is the headless-harness oracle and it never recorded the Colorless pool at all, so it cannot say which rows are epoch-gated; `COLORLESS_CARD_IDS` froze the fully-unlocked projection, which is only one profile's answer. `ColorlessCardPool::GenerateAllCards` 0xf11a0 is a literal 65-element `ModelDb.Card<T>()` array whose order is RNG-significant, and `FilterThroughEpochs` 0xf13f4 is the `IsEpochRevealed<Colorless<N>Epoch>` chain that removes fifteen rows, three at each of the five Colorless epochs. The two profile-independent predicates are the per-card `get_MultiplayerConstraint` / `get_CanBeGeneratedInCombat` columns carried here for the partition cross-check.",
  "rvas": {
   "colorless_card_pool_GenerateAllCards": "0xf11a0",
   "colorless_card_pool_FilterThroughEpochs": "0xf13f4",
   "card_pool_model_GetUnlockedCards": "0x7e54c",
   "card_model_get_multiplayer_constraint": "0x7c874",
   "card_model_get_can_be_generated_in_combat": "0x7cd97",
